  "ambient": {
    "_note": "Ambient life (window 2): a light, sparse drift in the air of each biome, made around the fighters (the camera frames them), by the biome at the pair's middle. `by_biome` names a recipe; a recipe is a list of emitters (rate a second at quality 1, halved in reduced motion) and a cap on how many of its flecks live at once. Wind (`vx`) and `vy` are signed world units a second; `h` is the spawn height above the ground; colours are tokens (lit, mid, shade, ej0, ej1 of Art's plume for the biome) or a hex. Everything is a small faceted fleck in Art's colours: no haze, no blur, no screen effect. Heat shimmer is rising motes of warm light, a geometry-and-particle answer, never a distortion.",
